 move **Q: h4-f2** delivers check to the White King on e2. This forces White to respond immediately to the check. Given that White's King is centralized and somewhat exposed (only the Queen on d2 nearby), this check creates maximum pressure. The King will likely have to move to d1, e1, d3, or e3, and in all cases, my Queen will be actively placed to continue the attack. This is a forcing move that seizes the initiative.\n\nAnswer: Q: h4-f2"}
