wns\n- Creates tactical threats against White's vulnerable king position\n- Controls critical central squares\n- Puts maximum pressure on White's position\n\nThis move exploits White's king vulnerability and improves my piece activity dramatically.\n\nAnswer: N: c6-d4"}
