nant file\n- It keeps the initiative firmly in my hands\n- With my material advantage, forcing moves that restrict White's options are ideal\n\n**Reason:**\nWith a winning material advantage, I should maintain maximum pressure and activity. Giving check with the Rook keeps White on the defensive and prevents any counterplay. This move is the most forcing and maintains all my advantages while improving my position.\n\n**Answer:** R: d1-c1"}
