ove, delivering check while keeping White's King under maximum pressure. In endgames with material advantage, maintaining the initiative through checks and forcing moves is crucial. This move restricts White's options and allows me to dictate the pace of the game while maintaining my significant material advantage.\n\nAnswer: R: a1-a2"}
